# Migrate your basic card integration

Migrate your mobile app to an integration that can handle bank requests for card authentication.

## Index

This article has multiple variants. Fetch one of the following URLs to view specific content for your use case:

- [iOS](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/upgrade-to-handle-actions.md?platform=ios)
- [Android](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/upgrade-to-handle-actions.md?platform=android)
- [React Native](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/upgrade-to-handle-actions.md?platform=react-native)
